<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!-- Flash Freeze, granted while the frost rifle is equipped (CompFrostGun). Numbers are
       placeholders; every balance number is a field here.

       Target: one pawn in line of sight within 22 cells that is Soaked (the water gun's
       AG_Soaked) or has requiredChilledStacks Chilled stacks. Anyone else is refused with the
       reason on the mouse label. Cost: 10 coolant. The freeze uses up the Soaked and Chilled it
       needed (consumeCondition).

       The freeze is a stun (no mote, no turning) for freezeSeconds, with the AG_FrostGunFrozen
       hediff as its record. The next damage the pawn takes shatters the ice: shatterDamage more of
       shatterDamageDef, then it is free. Otherwise it thaws.

       warmupTime 0.8 is the charge at the muzzle; the beam then crosses at 60 cells a second and
       the freeze lands when it arrives (MapComponent_FrostGun). The cast job holds the caster, gun
       aimed, until 0.15 s after the beam lands.

       Sounds are vanilla placeholders: warmup Interact_ChargeLance, cast ChargeLance_Fire, freeze
       EnergyShield_Reset, shatter GestatorGlassShattered; the thaw is silent. -->
  <AbilityDef>
    <defName>AG_FrostGun_FlashFreeze</defName>
    <label>flash freeze</label>
    <description>Charge the rifle and fire a freezing beam at one creature in sight that is soaked or chilled 3 times. It is frozen solid in ice for 5 seconds: it cannot move or act. The next hit it takes shatters the ice for 15 more damage; otherwise it thaws. Freezing uses up the soaking or the chill. Uses 10 coolant.</description>
    <iconPath>RimArt/FrostGun/IconFlashFreeze</iconPath>
    <category>AG_Genetic</category>
    <jobDef>AG_CastFrostGun</jobDef>
    <targetRequired>true</targetRequired>
    <hostile>true</hostile>
    <aiCanUse>false</aiCanUse>
    <casterMustBeCapableOfViolence>true</casterMustBeCapableOfViolence>
    <sendMessageOnCooldownComplete>false</sendMessageOnCooldownComplete>
    <cooldownTicksRange>1800</cooldownTicksRange>
    <warmupStartSound>Interact_ChargeLance</warmupStartSound>
    <verbProperties>
      <verbClass>Verb_CastAbility</verbClass>
      <range>22.9</range>
      <warmupTime>0.8</warmupTime>
      <drawAimPie>false</drawAimPie>
      <requireLineOfSight>true</requireLineOfSight>
      <soundCast>ChargeLance_Fire</soundCast>
      <targetParams>
        <canTargetSelf>false</canTargetSelf>
        <canTargetLocations>false</canTargetLocations>
        <canTargetPawns>true</canTargetPawns>
        <canTargetAnimals>true</canTargetAnimals>
        <canTargetMechs>true</canTargetMechs>
        <canTargetBuildings>false</canTargetBuildings>
      </targetParams>
    </verbProperties>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimArt.CompProperties_FlashFreeze">
        <cost>10</cost>
        <freezeSeconds>5</freezeSeconds>
        <requiredChilledStacks>3</requiredChilledStacks>
        <consumeCondition>true</consumeCondition>
        <shatterDamage>15</shatterDamage>
        <shatterDamageDef>Cut</shatterDamageDef>
        <shatterArmorPenetration>0.2</shatterArmorPenetration>
        <soundFreeze>EnergyShield_Reset</soundFreeze>
        <soundShatter>GestatorGlassShattered</soundShatter>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </AbilityDef>

</Defs>
